# Kakao — environment variables template.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill values locally. `.env` is git-ignored; `.env.example`
# is committed and must list EVERY variable the project reads, with NO values.
#
# The MVP is fully local (see docs/ai-context/DECISIONS.md, D-001). It needs no
# API keys or secrets, so this file is intentionally empty for now.
#
# Variables get added here the moment any code reads one — e.g. if the Phase 0
# gate fails and the project pivots to a paid translation API (see ROADMAP.md),
# that provider's key is declared here first.
